'''Sunkern''' (Japanese: '''ヒマナッツ''' ''Himanuts'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

