==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Sunkern|7}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Blot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Erika's Oddish|78}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

